{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S09把‘难受时想有人陪’进一步解释成‘怕孤单到愿意再受旧气’，虽然更有戏剧张力，但也替人物多下了一层判断，削弱了一点原本的开放性。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y通过【】突出每段真正重要的心理转折，话与感受交替呈现，感受又与音乐实际发生的时点对应，观众更容易边听边抓住信息，不必在X右栏的大量短词中自行寻找重点。更重要的是，Y把受过的委屈、怀念亲近、害怕孤单、不甘心回头和最终带着想念继续生活之间的关系交代得更清楚，人物为什么反复动摇、又为什么最终选择向前，都比较容易理解。音乐感受方面，Y的音色、节奏、身体反应和情绪变化结合得更具体，前后反复出现的主题也形成了连续的心理轨迹。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7f00a936-eaa6-4951-b0fa-09f6bd2db801", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T232111472460Z", "elapsed_seconds": 40.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:21:52.282751+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c5e90513b72010cabc8456d834e4d3244753400f1d5b8eceae4360cdcc4dd3ae", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33c